  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuvalu Coastal Adaptation Project (TCAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will&#xa0;contribute NZ$9.15 million to the second phase of the Tuvalu Coastal Adaptation Project (TCAP). This will see TCAP extended to the southern end of the first phase of TCAP reclamation work completed on Funafuti.&#xa0;It will also build capacity in resilient coastal management and include feasibility, planning and construction activities for the northern extension and land use planning and implementation across 1A and 1B.</narrative>
  </description>
